# Patrone's apps, for Ubuntu 26.04 and systems built on it, from
# billsecond.github.io/patrone-apt (GitHub Pages): the "apps" component,
# which has only Patrone's apps, never the packages that make a system
# PatroneOS or Patrone's builds of Ubuntu's packages. Goes in
# /etc/apt/sources.list.d/, with the key in /usr/share/keyrings/ (the
# README, "Patrone's apps on Ubuntu"). PatroneOS uses patrone.sources instead.
Types: deb
URIs: https://billsecond.github.io/patrone-apt
Suites: resolute
Components: apps
Architectures: amd64
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/patrone-archive-keyring.gpg
